<title>NEW ZEALAND: INL half-yr net profit NZ$26.19 mln.</title>
<headline>INL half-yr net profit NZ$26.19 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 26.19 vs 25.96</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 20.3 vs 20.2</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 11.0 vs 11.0</p>
